#: eac8aa30e19244eb84dad155662710b1
msgid "RFD900 Radio Modem"
msgstr "RFD900 无线电调制解调器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rfd900.rst:7 00981e6b058e4f559161d6572dd2cebe
#: 232017e63697473ab69800e897b59663 448284d327fc48a49c14501dddb8b090
#: 7a2236e1ac4a4fbcb08f5221a7b8f362 7faf91cc64744c2088d18db64408323a
#: 8c9a17da75054a5482009bc288f57ce5
msgid ""
"The RFD900 Radio Modem is a high powered 900Mhz, ISM band radio modem "
"designed for long range serial communication.  Ranges of `15km and much "
"higher have been reported <http://www.edgeresearchlab.org/our-"
"projects/edge4-16-feb-2013/rfd900/>`__."
msgstr ""
"RFD900 无线电调制解调器是一款高功率 900 MHz ISM 频段无线电调制解调器，专为长距离串行通信设计。据报道 `通信距离可达15km甚至更远"
" <http://www.edgeresearchlab.org/our-projects/edge4-16-feb-2013/rfd900/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rfd900.rst:12 45589038a6fc4978b066dae939963775
#: 4cf65026b2ad4659b049144889e4d5b2 4fa2d8fb1be7486c9a7aa72a4c921716
#: 8d3e65f6ed6945b6be31eca5ed0a3e6e eb737d3388ab4e8c94d1c62fccdbe873
#: ecb7efabb1c042f28ee90e38b405866b
msgid ""
"Many common autopilots have telemetry port current limits that prevent "
"directly powering RFD900 radios at their full transmit power. You should "
"power high power radios externally or limit their maximum transmit power to "
"an acceptable level.All commonly used autopilots should be able to handle "
"transmit powers of 20dBm.  See the manual of your specific autopilot for the"
" detailed power specifications of each telemetry port. To set the transmit "
"(TX) power see :ref:`Configuring a Telemetry Radio using Mission Planner "
"<common-configuring-a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"许多常见飞控的数传端口电流限制使其无法在全功率下直接为 RFD900 "
"无线电供电。您应从外部为高功率无线电供电，或将其最大发射功率限制在可接受水平。所有常用飞控应能处理20dBm的发射功率。请参阅您所用飞控的手册，了解各数传端口的详细功率规格。要设置发射（TX）功率，请参阅"
" :ref:`通过 Mission Planner 配置数传电台 <common-configuring-a-telemetry-radio-"
"using-mission-planner>`。"

