#: 8deffc5f627341e1be40381d227a40f3 906d8246435c4ef094e86d595d741d18
#: cc6ee2defd734c9c88ab2bb6dab1e2bb
msgid ""
"The hardware is closed source but the `software is open "
"<https://github.com/RFDesign/SiK>`__ and is based on the same software that "
"runs on the :ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` meaning "
"configuration and setup is extremely similar and these radios can even be "
"paired with a 900Mhz SiK radio (i.e. you may choose to use one RFD900 on the"
" ground, and a SiK radio in the aircraft)."
msgstr ""
"硬件为闭源，但 `软件是开源的 <https://github.com/RFDesign/SiK>`__，且基于与 :ref:`SiK 电台 "
"<common-sik-telemetry-radio>` 相同的软件，因此配置和设置极为相似，这些电台甚至可以与900 MHz SiK "
"电台配对（即可选择在地面使用一台 RFD900，在飞行器上使用 SiK 电台）。"

